The lands herein reserved have been 
withdrawn or acquired for reclamation 
purposes in connection with the Baker 
Reclamation Project, and their reserva­
tion and use as the Thief Valley National 
Wildlife Refuge shall be without inter­
ference with their use for such reclama­
tion purposes and pursuant to the recla­
mation laws.
This reservation shall be known as the 
Thief Valley National Wildlife Refuge.
